  "description": "<p>Please submit the email and organizations you will be emailing on this form: <a class=\"inline_disabled\" title=\"Link\" href=\"https://form.jotform.com/FORM_ID\" target=\"_blank\">https://form.jotform.com/FORM_ID</a></p>\n<p>Upload screen shots of your 3 successful submissions to this assignment.</p>\n<p><strong>Note: You must submit this form 3x. If you try to submit an email and you get a popup informing you the email has already been contacted, please continue to submit 3 emails/orgs, and then email Teacher E and Teacher F.&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>Even after you send your 3 emails, if you are sending more emails, <strong>you must submit a jotform before sending anything else!</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: #fbeeb8;\"><strong>Don't forget! CC Teacher E and Teacher F on every email.</strong></span></p>\n<p>1 point per form. Must submit 3 forms to meet expectations.</p>",
